    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i don't want to find \"small things\" for myself. i don't even like the things i used to like. everything is just colored in grey. it feels like i'm just waiting for my life to be over because the version of me that actually lived is gone. it would be so much easier if i didn't have to keep dragging this empty shell around.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
